{{Term/Store|Firefly|Fireflies|Series, TWW, TWWHD, SS, SSHD, BotW, TotK, ZA, AoC, AoI|plural}} are a recurring species in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|TWW, SS, BotW, TotK, ZA, AoC}}<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= E |publisher= |page= 124 {{Exp Game|TWW, TWWHD}}}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= E |publisher= |page= 139 {{Exp Game|SS}}}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|{{Color SSHD|Gear Heading|{{Big|'''Starry Firefly'''}}}}<br/>{{Color SSHD|Dialogue|A glowing Skyloft insect that only comes out at night. Its beauty is said to calm the mind.}}|Collection|SSHD}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Sunset Firefly}}<br/>These fireflies glow gently in the dark. When cooked with monster parts, the compound that causes it to glow results in an elixir that will allow you to move more quietly.|Inventory|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Deep Firefly}}<br/>A multi-winged insect that lives in the Depths. It excretes luminescent elements that can be cooked into an elixir, which will add a faint glow to anyone who consumes it.|Inventory|TotK}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Magazine|quote= S7-9: Vier Fireflies.|translation= S7-9: Four Fireflies.|magazine= ''CD Interactief''|volume= |issue= |date= June/July 1999|publisher= HUB Uitgevers|page= 6}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Sunset Firefly}}<br/>These fireflies glow gently in the dark. The compound that causes it to glow is said to improve concentration.|Material (Interface)|AoC}}</ref><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Characteristics==
==={{TWW|-}}===
{{Main|Forest Firefly}}
A variety of Firefly known as the [[Forest Firefly]] was once used to create colored [[Pictograph]]s, though this practice has long been abandoned according to [[Lenzo]].<ref>{{Cite|What a curious luminescence... Is that truly one of the long-fabled Forest Fireflies from Forest Haven? My fine assistant, Link... For ages, it has been said that the Forest Fireflies possess a mystical power. In the old days, they were required for making colored pictographs...but no longer.|Lenzo|TWWHD}}</ref> 

==={{SS|-}}===
{{Main|Starry Firefly}}
[[Starry Firefly|Starry Fireflies]] are used by residents of [[Skyloft]] to [[Upgrade]] their [[Potion]]s.

==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Main|Sunset Firefly}}
Sunset Fireflies can be found throughout [[Hyrule]] at nighttime, where they have a reputation for increasing [[Stealth]].

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Main|Deep Firefly, Sunset Firefly}}
Two varieties of Firefly appear in {{TotK}}: [[Deep Firefly|Deep Fireflies]] and [[Sunset Firefly|Sunset Fireflies]]. Deep Fireflies are found in the [[Depths]], where they emit a [[Glow]] that can be transferred to [[Elixir]]s when used as [[Ingredient]]s. Sunset Fireflies can similarly be used as Ingredients to boost [[Stealth]].

